WEBVTT

00:00:20.860 --> 00:00:22.520
Thank you.

00:00:22.520 --> 00:00:24.690
It's my first time staying at a company!

00:00:24.690 --> 00:00:26.600
Exciting school trip!

00:00:26.600 --> 00:00:27.570
It's so much fun!

00:00:35.180 --> 00:00:36.180
My bag?

00:01:06.970 --> 00:01:23.760
Oh no, oh no!

00:01:23.760 --> 00:01:25.680
What the hell are you guys...

00:01:25.680 --> 00:01:29.200
Hello!

00:01:32.300 --> 00:01:32.760
*sigh*

00:03:21.050 --> 00:03:23.000
Because I wanted to come.

00:03:23.000 --> 00:03:26.200
Even though it's a school trip.

00:03:38.250 --> 00:03:40.270
If I become a first-year student, I can go.

00:03:40.270 --> 00:03:43.240
Why is there no school trip for first-year students?

00:03:44.780 --> 00:03:49.360
I came secretly.

00:03:49.360 --> 00:03:52.720
I didn't come!

00:03:52.720 --> 00:03:55.640
Just a little.

00:03:55.640 --> 00:03:59.250
Wait!

00:03:59.250 --> 00:04:00.000
Oh, excuse me.

00:04:03.930 --> 00:04:07.200
Well, it's a coincidence, isn't it, Precure?

00:04:07.200 --> 00:04:09.320
Why are you here?

00:04:09.320 --> 00:04:11.760
That's obvious, isn't it?

00:04:11.760 --> 00:04:16.240
After all, everyone was full of energy on their school trip.

00:04:16.240 --> 00:04:25.410
I felt a lot of motivation, so I disguised myself and sneaked in to get it all.

00:04:25.410 --> 00:04:26.950
Good work.

00:04:26.950 --> 00:04:28.290
Hey!

00:04:31.080 --> 00:04:31.910
No, don't do that!

00:04:31.910 --> 00:04:32.850
No, don't do that!

00:04:32.850 --> 00:04:39.730
We're about to land at Yamanonaka Station.

00:04:39.730 --> 00:04:41.690
We're about to land at Yamanonaka Station.

00:04:41.690 --> 00:04:47.480
It seems like we're going to land just in time.

00:04:47.480 --> 00:04:49.910
It'll be a mess if we take the train.

00:04:49.910 --> 00:04:52.850
Get out of the station.

00:04:52.850 --> 00:04:56.660
What's with this attitude?

00:04:56.660 --> 00:04:59.230
Well, whatever.

00:04:59.230 --> 00:05:00.000
No matter what happens...

00:05:00.000 --> 00:05:03.600
In such a small place, I'm not going to do anything.

00:05:03.600 --> 00:05:05.910
I won't let you out.

00:05:05.910 --> 00:05:14.890
Leave this to me.

00:05:14.890 --> 00:05:21.970
Yeah.

00:05:21.970 --> 00:05:30.000
I can't see this train.

00:05:30.670 --> 00:05:34.010
I think it's around the time we arrived at Yamanonaka Station.

00:05:34.010 --> 00:05:37.070
I'm sure we'll catch up with them before sunset!

00:05:37.070 --> 00:05:38.290
Yeah!

00:06:04.030 --> 00:06:05.380
W-Wait!

00:06:05.380 --> 00:06:16.800
But we have no choice but to get serious.

00:06:16.800 --> 00:06:21.870
I thought about it.

00:06:21.870 --> 00:06:24.320
It's hard to be seen by others.

00:06:24.320 --> 00:06:27.200
Let's have a pre-cure here.

00:06:27.200 --> 00:06:28.400
Takizawa-san?

00:06:28.400 --> 00:06:29.440
Who are you with?

00:06:30.830 --> 00:06:32.360
What do you want?

00:06:32.360 --> 00:06:35.550
I heard someone talking just now.

00:06:35.550 --> 00:06:37.120
He's been alone all this time.

00:06:37.120 --> 00:06:40.080
Did he have a fight with someone outside just now?

00:06:40.080 --> 00:06:42.550
No, not really.

00:06:42.550 --> 00:06:46.530
I'll tell him as the student council president.

00:06:46.530 --> 00:06:49.140
Don't make a fuss again.

00:06:49.140 --> 00:06:50.040
What?

00:07:14.680 --> 00:07:16.680
That's why you'll find me if you walk around.

00:07:16.680 --> 00:07:18.810
It's okay.

00:07:18.810 --> 00:07:20.810
That time is that time.

00:07:20.810 --> 00:07:24.210
Hey.

00:07:24.210 --> 00:07:27.240
What was the student president talking about?

00:07:27.240 --> 00:07:29.260
What?

00:07:29.260 --> 00:07:30.000
Nothing.

00:07:30.440 --> 00:07:31.820
It's not a big deal.

00:07:31.820 --> 00:07:35.800
It's not like that, is it?

00:07:35.800 --> 00:07:38.020
Hey, try saying it.

00:07:38.020 --> 00:07:40.700
You said you would write down the shame of the trip, didn't you?

00:07:40.700 --> 00:07:43.180
What?

00:07:43.180 --> 00:07:45.690
I learned it in class.

00:07:45.690 --> 00:07:49.600
Don't be embarrassed on the trip and say anything.

00:07:49.600 --> 00:07:51.370
It's different, isn't it?

00:07:51.370 --> 00:07:57.000
It means that there is nothing to be embarrassed about because you are a stranger on the trip.

00:07:57.000 --> 00:07:59.720
It's the same after all.

00:08:02.300 --> 00:08:10.020
On a journey, you can open your heart and beat it.

00:08:10.020 --> 00:08:12.740
We're friends, aren't we?

00:08:12.740 --> 00:08:15.120
We're the same Pre-Cure.

00:08:15.120 --> 00:08:16.880
Friends?

00:08:16.880 --> 00:08:25.440
I don't need friends.

00:08:25.440 --> 00:08:29.540
I've been with Yuriko since elementary school.

00:08:30.250 --> 00:08:34.300
My personality is completely different, but I was interested.

00:08:34.300 --> 00:08:37.460
After I got into junior high school, I joined the tennis club together.

00:09:00.120 --> 00:09:05.600
By that time, we were about to be marked by Kyogoku.

00:09:05.600 --> 00:09:07.590
So there were a lot of enemies.

00:09:07.590 --> 00:09:12.710
Yes. And it was before the final.

00:09:12.710 --> 00:09:18.750
Hurry up! We'll be found!

00:09:18.750 --> 00:09:19.900
I know!

00:09:21.080 --> 00:09:22.080
Hey!

00:09:26.470 --> 00:09:29.250
Don't mess with me! How dare you use your friend's racket!

00:09:31.020 --> 00:09:37.050
Hey, what are you guys doing?

00:09:37.050 --> 00:09:40.820
Did you just mess up the locker?

00:09:40.820 --> 00:09:43.200
That's what they say.

00:09:43.200 --> 00:09:44.510
They did?

00:09:44.510 --> 00:09:46.660
I saw it.

00:09:46.660 --> 00:09:49.090
They tried to steal Yuriko's racket.

00:09:49.090 --> 00:09:50.640
But there's no evidence.

00:09:50.640 --> 00:09:52.010
Evidence?

00:09:52.010 --> 00:09:55.860
And then they said Asuka was attacked by violence.

00:09:55.860 --> 00:09:58.010
I didn't do anything!

00:09:58.010 --> 00:10:00.000
But what did you see when you grabbed her chest?

00:10:00.440 --> 00:10:02.650
I'm just stopping you!

00:10:02.650 --> 00:10:04.470
They're the ones who are at fault!

00:10:04.470 --> 00:10:05.470
I know that!

00:10:05.470 --> 00:10:07.740
Kuriko...

00:10:07.740 --> 00:10:11.770
There's no way I won't believe you.

00:10:11.770 --> 00:10:12.680
But...

00:10:12.680 --> 00:10:16.010
Your response is...

00:10:16.010 --> 00:10:17.930
I can't say that it was right.

00:10:17.930 --> 00:10:19.520
You always say that.

00:10:19.520 --> 00:10:23.340
It's going to be cut soon, so it's going to be like this.

00:10:23.340 --> 00:10:29.460
If it turns out to be a violence case, the tennis club will stop working.

00:10:30.000 --> 00:10:32.610
If you make it worse, you'll be disqualified.

00:10:32.610 --> 00:10:36.540
Disqualified? No way...

00:10:36.540 --> 00:10:40.090
But, it's fine.

00:10:40.090 --> 00:10:44.430
We've talked about this so as not to make it too obvious.

00:10:44.430 --> 00:10:47.560
Talked about it?

00:10:47.560 --> 00:10:53.920
The condition that the two of us and the opponent take this match to be dangerous.

00:10:53.920 --> 00:10:58.010
Dangerous? That's crazy!

00:10:58.010 --> 00:11:00.000
We're not doing anything wrong, but we're in danger!

00:11:00.730 --> 00:11:04.900
Do you think everyone will be able to accept such a strange conclusion?

00:11:04.900 --> 00:11:08.500
Let's fight fair and square with our friends.

00:11:08.500 --> 00:11:10.380
If we do that, I'm sure...

00:11:10.380 --> 00:11:13.570
If you make a fuss...

00:11:13.570 --> 00:11:15.810
I want to participate in the match.

00:11:15.810 --> 00:11:17.720
What?

00:11:17.720 --> 00:11:21.190
That's why you have to protest so that it doesn't happen.

00:11:21.190 --> 00:11:24.880
Rinna...

00:11:24.880 --> 00:11:28.100
Asuka!

00:11:28.100 --> 00:11:29.440
It's dangerous.

00:11:29.440 --> 00:11:30.000
The tennis club...

00:11:30.000 --> 00:11:32.220
As the leader of the team, for the sake of my friends...

00:11:32.220 --> 00:11:39.520
For the sake of your friends...

00:11:39.520 --> 00:11:46.330
Friends...

00:11:46.330 --> 00:11:49.950
Wait for me, Asuka!

00:11:49.950 --> 00:11:52.470
I don't need any friends.

00:12:00.920 --> 00:12:02.840
You're so strong.

00:12:02.840 --> 00:12:06.360
So that means you're going to sign a contract with the student council president?

00:12:06.360 --> 00:12:07.720
I don't know.

00:12:32.010 --> 00:12:33.900
YOLOLOLOLOLOLOLOLOLOLOLOLOLOLOLOLO

00:12:33.900 --> 00:12:53.200
Alchipower

00:13:07.520 --> 00:13:08.990
I got you.

00:13:08.990 --> 00:13:13.990
Everyone, calm down and head to the car in front of us.

00:13:13.990 --> 00:13:15.560
Dora-san?

00:13:15.560 --> 00:13:16.290
Ah...

00:13:16.290 --> 00:13:18.560
Why are you here?

00:13:18.560 --> 00:13:20.800
This is not the time for that!

00:13:20.800 --> 00:13:22.430
Asuka!

00:13:22.430 --> 00:13:26.340
I can't transform in front of everyone.

00:13:26.340 --> 00:13:28.290
First, let's escape.

00:13:30.760 --> 00:13:35.130
We're heading towards the observatory!

00:13:35.130 --> 00:13:37.930
Don't act like that and run away!

00:13:37.930 --> 00:13:40.410
What? You're the one who should step back!

00:13:40.410 --> 00:13:44.400
I'm here as the student council president.

00:13:44.400 --> 00:13:50.390
So you're here as the student council president.

00:13:50.390 --> 00:13:53.550
Yoro, Yoro!

00:13:56.270 --> 00:13:58.170
It's not the time to argue.

00:13:58.170 --> 00:13:59.030
You're right.

00:14:12.250 --> 00:14:14.250
I don't want to do it because I don't want to give up.

00:14:14.250 --> 00:14:15.200
I won't do it.

00:14:15.200 --> 00:14:17.310
First of all, stop the train.

00:14:17.310 --> 00:14:19.330
Dragato!

00:14:35.340 --> 00:14:39.010
Now, you'll get as much motivation as you want!

00:14:39.010 --> 00:14:41.970
I won't give up!

00:16:01.050 --> 00:16:01.890
Are you all right?

00:16:08.210 --> 00:16:10.730
Yes, I'm fine.

00:16:10.730 --> 00:16:12.860
I see. That's good.

00:16:16.050 --> 00:16:18.980
I'm your opponent!

00:16:18.980 --> 00:16:23.580
Haaah!

00:16:23.580 --> 00:16:25.480
You're on your own!

00:16:30.700 --> 00:16:34.130
Don't worry. I'll get everyone back to normal soon.

00:16:37.020 --> 00:16:41.680
Don't be like that.

00:16:41.680 --> 00:16:45.940
Flamingo!

00:16:45.940 --> 00:16:49.360
I'll get everyone's motivation back!

00:16:49.360 --> 00:16:50.680
What?

00:16:50.680 --> 00:16:52.610
You still want to get in my way?

00:16:52.610 --> 00:16:54.050
Don't do it.

00:16:54.050 --> 00:16:56.250
I'll beat you to a pulp.

00:16:56.250 --> 00:16:58.130
Gourmet Dough!

00:17:36.430 --> 00:17:42.960
That's it for today's video.

00:17:42.960 --> 00:17:44.850
Thank you for watching.

00:17:44.850 --> 00:17:46.580
See you in the next video.

00:18:02.940 --> 00:18:04.820
What are you doing, Yara-needa?

00:18:04.820 --> 00:18:06.570
Yara-needa...

00:18:09.550 --> 00:18:19.070
Yara-needa!

00:18:19.070 --> 00:18:23.130
I'm glad to hear that there's a Yara-needa here.

00:18:23.130 --> 00:18:25.210
Huh? I want to ask you something.

00:18:25.210 --> 00:18:26.290
Why?

00:18:26.290 --> 00:18:26.880
Huh?

00:18:26.880 --> 00:18:29.370
What is it? You didn't know?

00:18:29.370 --> 00:18:30.000
Yeah.

00:18:30.250 --> 00:18:30.900
Absolutely not!

00:19:37.000 --> 00:19:53.240
The power of magic, illuminate the earth!

00:20:18.720 --> 00:20:20.650
Train is no good.

00:20:20.650 --> 00:20:22.660
After all, the ship is the best.

00:20:22.660 --> 00:20:28.860
It's just a locomotive.

00:20:28.860 --> 00:20:30.000
I'm glad.

00:20:31.240 --> 00:20:32.790
Yuriko, are you alright?

00:20:32.790 --> 00:20:37.520
If I can relax, I'll be able to feel something...

00:20:37.520 --> 00:20:46.430
Ah...

00:20:46.430 --> 00:20:55.320
That's...

00:21:00.320 --> 00:21:02.210
Was it...?

00:21:02.210 --> 00:21:07.390
It's getting dark!

00:21:07.390 --> 00:21:10.370
I really wanted to stay, but...

00:21:10.370 --> 00:21:13.670
But it was really good, right?

00:21:13.670 --> 00:21:14.790
I made it in time...

00:21:14.790 --> 00:21:16.580
Even so...

00:21:16.580 --> 00:21:20.390
Asuka's forgotten things are thrown away and delivered on purpose.

00:21:20.390 --> 00:21:22.240
You're good, aren't you?

00:21:22.240 --> 00:21:24.870
In the first place, it's because of La Mer, isn't it?

00:21:24.870 --> 00:21:29.570
Because you took out the pillow from the travel bag...

00:21:34.190 --> 00:21:35.260
*giggle*

00:21:35.260 --> 00:21:41.320
*giggle*

00:21:41.320 --> 00:21:46.670
The pillow...

00:21:46.670 --> 00:21:49.550
It won't change, will it?

00:21:49.550 --> 00:21:51.670
If the pillow changes, I won't be able to sleep...

00:22:00.760 --> 00:22:01.830
No way...
